					<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Pedestrian: full-span q.PL x W.PL / 2, no impact. Vehicle: larger of truck alone or 25% truck plus lane load.</p>
					</text>
